    "body": "I'm going to land the PRs identified in https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/9000#issuecomment-2935265078 (including this one) soonish. We have reduced the scope to essentially only tackle the new way we integrate with Cookies at the IETF (and only for the Cookie and Set-Cookie header at this point). So in effect this should be a non-normative change.\r\n\r\nPRs building on top of this work will need to fill out the PR template completely however.",
